# Frontend Area Instructions

These instructions extend the repository root `AGENTS.md` for this subtree.

- Reuse the project design system and existing data-fetching/form patterns.
- Cover loading, empty, error, permission, long-content, and responsive states.
- Preserve semantic HTML, keyboard flow, focus, labels, and non-color status cues.
- Client checks improve UX but never replace server authorization or validation.
- Avoid unrelated visual redesign and broad formatting.
- Verify with targeted unit/component tests and the real user flow when tooling exists.
- Update frontend/design department memory only for reusable, evidence-backed conventions.
